        "title": "Gen6 CTRPF Overhauled",
        "author": "samaBR85",
        "description": "Installs the plugin and its data folder to the SD root for all four Gen 6 games (X / Y / Omega Ruby / Alpha Sapphire). One .3gx auto-detects the game. Save the game in-plugin to keep changes.",
